## Update Checklist

Before publishing any Maple update:

1. **Fetch from DefiLlama API:**
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/protocol/maple` for TVL
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/summary/fees/maple` for fees
   - Extract: TVL, borrowed amount, staking TVL, fee metrics

2. **Fetch from CoinGecko API:**
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/syrup` for SYRUP token
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/syrupusdc` for syrupUSDC
   - Extract: Prices, market caps, supply, ATH/ATL

3. **Update report metrics:**
   - [ ] TVL (currently $2.56B)
   - [ ] Borrowed amount ($1.81B)
   - [ ] Fee data (24h, 7d, 30d, all-time)
   - [ ] SYRUP token price and market cap
   - [ ] syrupUSDC price and TVL

4. **Update footnotes:**
   - [ ] Note "retrieved via [API name] API" for all API data
   - [ ] Add HARD DATA markers

5. **Citation check:**
   - [ ] Every footnote `[^N]:` has at least one `[^N]` reference in body
   - [ ] Run: `grep -o '\[\^[0-9]*\]' maple_finance.md | sort -u | wc -l`
   - [ ] Result should be 55+ (matching footnote count)

6. **Quality check:**
   - [ ] All numbers consistent across report
   - [ ] SYRUP token (not MPL) used throughout
   - [ ] Fee calculations shown with assumptions

